 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts     |  13 ++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225.dtsi          | 121 +++++++++++
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss.c     | 195 ++++++++++++++++++
